title: "CIM-C Digital Twin"
abstract: >-
  3D digital twin of the CIM-C didactic manufacturing plant of CEFET-MG,
  Leopoldina campus (Brazil), controlled by a PLC through OPC UA for
  Software-in-the-Loop validation of control logic.
